      "text": "Nephi1 asks the Lord where he can find ore for tools, 1 Ne. 17:9. people of Lehi1 find all manner of ore in wilderness, 1 Ne. 18:25. Nephi1 makes plates of ore, 1 Ne. 19:1. Nephi1 teaches people to work in precious ores, 2 Ne. 5:15. Nephites search for precious ores, Jacob 2:12. record of Jaredites engraven on plates of ore, Mosiah 21:27. precious ore of every kind in promised land, Hel. 6:11. Jaredites work in all manner of ore, Ether 10:23.",
